I have found another way of escaping the greedy shopkeeper (also forgetful,
I might add!).  I was being punished and found an antique shop.  I let
my dog carry a few things out for me -- then got hungry.  I ran in and
grabbed some not-so-antique food and fed myself.  I then grabbed a couple
other things and, on a lark, threw my ball at the door.  I landed directly
in front of it.  What a joy!  The shopkeeper, seeing himself outsmarted,
let me escape.  My only regret is that I had not picked up all the other
things in the shop.  Oh well....

